# Secrets. Never commit real credentials.
# Both spellings, dotted and not: a file named `env` is NOT matched by `.env`,
# and one holding a live service-role key sat untracked-but-committable here
# until 2026-08-02. Only the .example templates are allowed through.
.env
.env.*
env
*.env
!.env.example
!env.example

